2026-07-27T08:18:54.0389690Z i /tmp/RtmpH8xlIX/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0390187Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0390774Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0391461Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0392248Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0393405Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:18:54.0394289Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
